# The unit tier's dependencies, exact pins, compiled into the hash lock
# tests/unit/requirements.txt next to this file. Regenerate that lock with the
# command in its own header (see docs/TESTING.md, "The unit tier"), never by
# hand. Renovate's pip-compile manager bumps a pin here and replays the same
# command.
#
# Separate from tests/requirements.txt, which is the integration suite's
# environment and drags in the Docker SDK, testinfra and the HTTP clients the
# stack tests need. The unit tier needs none of that: pytest to run it,
# coverage to measure it, and pyyaml because permissions.py and
# generate-homepage-services.py import it. Keep pytest and pyyaml equal to the
# integration pins.
coverage==7.16.1
pytest==9.1.1
pyyaml==6.0.3
